--- n=4  (1/n=1/4, 2/n=1/2, n/2=2) ---
  delete a= 1: M=2/5  RAISED to 2/5=0.4000 @t=4/5
  delete a= 2: M=1/2  RAISED to 1/2=0.5000 @t=1/2  <== self-conjugate n/2
  delete a= 3: M=1/3  RAISED to 1/3=0.3333 @t=2/3
  >> max gap after a single deletion: 1/2=0.50000 at a=[2]  (2/n=1/2)
  >> n/2 is the UNIQUE maximal guard? True

